HI!

Find a new release of web2ldap on

         http://www.web2ldap.de/download.html

About:
web2ldap is a full-featured LDAP client written in Python and designed to
run as a stand-alone Web gateway or under the control of a web server with
FastCGI or SCGI support (e.g., Apache with mod_fastcgi or mod_scgi).

Ciao, Michael.

0.13.0

Release Date: 2004-03-29

Installation and Configuration changes

+ Note: This release requires upgrading to python-ldap 2.0.0pre20+
   and OpenLDAP libs 2.1.x+!
+ New host-specific parameter login_default_mech.

New features/enhancements

+ Support for SASL bind! [..]
+ sbin/checkinst.py displays version information of OpenLDAP client
   libs.

Bug fixes

+ Fixed mixing the search results of a one-level search from
   - World - with namingContexts.

